sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Source service
  participant G as Gateway
  participant K as Kafka
  participant W as Evidence worker
  participant D as Postgres
  S->>G: POST /events (ReturnEvent)
  G->>G: validate schema
  alt invalid
    G-->>S: 422 (never published)
  else bus down
    G-->>S: 503 (caller retries)
  else ok
    G->>K: publish(key=return_id)
    G-->>S: 202
  end
  K->>W: deliver (at least once)
  W->>D: ledger check (group, event_id)
  alt already done
    W->>D: bump duplicate counter, refresh snapshot
  else new
    W->>D: store event, recompute reconciliation snapshot
  end
  alt handler keeps failing
    W->>K: publish to DLQ after N attempts
  end
  W->>K: commit offset
